From 063c8646db849c27a462317b3d9cc22d9189791d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: riotashley81-jpg <riotashley81@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:42:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] Native-wide: auxiliary offscreen layer with reveal
 margins

A display-sized offscreen layer that a game pastes back over the screen
(Vagrant Story's depth-of-field blur) gets a wide surface of its own, and
textured batches sampling it are drawn again into the display's margins,
shifted by whole display widths, reading the layer's wide margins.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
